<template>
  <main class="match-page">
    <section class="match-hero">
      <div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><i class="el-icon-camera" /> 图片组智能检索</span><h1>图片智能匹配</h1><p>上传物品的不同角度照片，系统会对整组图片进行相似度比对，帮助你更快发现可能相关的信息。</p><div class="hero-tips"><span><i class="el-icon-picture-outline" /> 支持 1—3 张图片</span><span><i class="el-icon-sort" /> 多图综合评分</span><span><i class="el-icon-lock" /> 仅用于本次检索</span></div></div>
      <div class="hero-art"><span class="photo photo-a"><i class="el-icon-picture" /></span><span class="photo photo-b"><i class="el-icon-camera-solid" /></span><span class="search-orbit"><i class="el-icon-search" /></span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="matcher-card">
      <div class="step"><span>01</span><div><h2>选择匹配方向</h2><p>告诉系统你希望查找哪一类信息</p></div></div>
      <div class="direction-grid">
        <button :class="['direction-card',{active:direction==='lost'}]" @click="direction='lost'"><span class="direction-icon lost"><i class="el-icon-search" /></span><div><strong>我丢失了物品</strong><p>从招领信息中寻找相似物品</p></div><i class="check el-icon-circle-check" /></button>
        <button :class="['direction-card',{active:direction==='found'}]" @click="direction='found'"><span class="direction-icon found"><i class="el-icon-present" /></span><div><strong>我捡到了物品</strong><p>从失物信息中寻找可能的失主</p></div><i class="check el-icon-circle-check" /></button>
      </div>

      <div class="divider" />
      <div class="step"><span>02</span><div><h2>上传物品图片</h2><p>建议上传整体、侧面和显著特征，多图匹配更准确</p></div></div>
      <div class="upload-zone"><img-upload v-model="images" :limit="3" /><div class="upload-note"><i class="el-icon-info" /><span>请使用清晰、主体完整的照片，避免截图、水印和过于复杂的背景。</span></div></div>

      <div class="divider" />
      <div class="step"><span>03</span><div><h2>补充线索 <em>选填</em></h2><p>名称、颜色、地点等信息有助于你确认结果</p></div></div>
      <el-input v-model="description" type="textarea" :rows="4" maxlength="300" show-word-limit placeholder="例如：黑色双肩包，8 月 12 日晚在图书馆三楼遗失，侧面挂有蓝色钥匙扣……" />
      <div class="action-bar"><div><strong>{{ uploadedCount ? `已上传 ${uploadedCount} 张图片` : '请先上传物品图片' }}</strong><p>每次最多展示匹配度最高的 4 条结果</p></div><el-button type="primary" :loading="loading" :disabled="!uploadedCount" @click="match"><i class="el-icon-search" /> {{ loading ? '正在匹配' : '开始图片匹配' }}</el-button></div>
    </section>

    <section v-if="searched" class="results-section">
      <div class="result-heading"><div><span class="result-kicker">MATCH RESULTS</span><h2>匹配结果</h2><p v-if="results.length">找到 {{ results.length }} 条可能相关的信息，请结合物品特征进一步确认。</p><p v-else>本次没有找到可信的相似结果，可以更换角度清晰的图片后重试。</p></div><el-tag v-if="results.length" type="success" effect="plain"><i class="el-icon-sort-down" /> 按图片组相似度排序</el-tag></div>
      <el-empty v-if="!results.length" description="暂无可信的相似物品"><el-button type="primary" plain @click="searched=false">重新上传图片</el-button></el-empty>
      <div v-else class="result-grid">
        <article v-for="(result,index) in results" :key="result.groupId || result.businessId" class="result-card" @click="goDetail(result)">
          <div class="result-cover"><img v-if="hasImage(result)" :src="result.coverImage" :alt="result.itemName" @error="imageError(result.businessId)"><div v-else class="image-empty"><i class="el-icon-picture-outline" /><span>暂无图片</span></div><span class="rank">TOP {{ index + 1 }}</span><span class="score">{{ percent(result.score) }}<small>匹配度</small></span></div>
